わけがない これはネタじゃない からこそ許せない 完璧じゃない
No way, this isn't a joke, which is why I can't forgive it. You're not perfect.

404
00:51:31,130 --> 00:51:37,130
君じゃ許さない 自分を許さない 誰よりも強い君以外は認めない
I won't forgive you, I won't forgive myself. I won't accept anyone other than you, who are stronger than anyone.

405
00:51:37,130 --> 00:51:42,630
誰もを強く信じあてがってる まさに最強で無敵のアイドル
Trusting everyone strongly, you are truly the strongest and invincible idol.

406
00:51:42,630 --> 00:51:48,530
弱点なんて見当たらない 一番星を宿している
Not a single weakness in sight, holding the morning star within.

407
00:51:48,630 --> 00:51:54,130
弱いとこなんて見せちゃダメダメ 知りたくないここは見せずに
You mustn't show any weak spots, you mustn't let them know; hiding places like this,

408
00:51:54,130 --> 00:51:57,330
唯一無二じゃなくちゃイヤイヤ
If you aren't one and only, no way!

409
00:51:57,330 --> 00:52:00,430
それこそ本物の愛
That precisely is true love.

410
00:52:00,530 --> 00:52:04,530
得意の笑顔で隠すエリア 隠しきるこの秘密だけは
The area hidden by your signature smile, only this secret you conceal completely

411
00:52:04,530 --> 00:52:07,630
愛してるって嘘でつむぐキャリア
Is a career woven with the lie of 'I love you'.

412
00:52:07,630 --> 00:52:13,230
これこそ私なりの愛だ 流れ出す汗も綺麗なアクア
This is my kind of love; the flowing sweat is also a beautiful aqua.

413
00:52:13,230 --> 00:52:16,530
ルビーを隠したこのまぶた 歌い踊り舞う私はマリア
This eyelid hiding a ruby, singing, dancing, and twirling, I am Maria.

414
00:52:16,530 --> 00:52:20,030
そう嘘はとびきりの愛だ
Yes, lies are supreme love.

415
00:52:24,830 --> 00:52:34,630
誰かに愛されたことも 誰かのこと愛したこともない
I've never been loved by anyone, nor have I ever loved anyone.

416
00:52:34,630 --> 00:52:37,430
そんな私の嘘が いつか本当になること
Hoping that my lies like these will someday become the truth,

417
00:52:37,430 --> 00:52:39,530
信じてる
I believe.

418
00:52:39,530 --> 00:52:45,130
いつかきっと全部手に入れる 私はそう欲張りなアイドル
Someday I'll surely get everything; I am such a greedy idol.

419
00:52:45,130 --> 00:52:50,930
等身大でみんなのことちゃんと愛したいから
Because I want to truly love everyone with my real self,

420
00:52:50,930 --> 00:52:56,930
今日も嘘をつくの この言葉がいつか本当になる日を願って
Today too I tell lies, wishing for the day these words will truly come true.

421
00:52:56,930 --> 00:53:03,630
それでもまだ 君と君にだけは言えずにいたけど
Even so, I still couldn't say it to you and only you...

422
00:53:03,630 --> 00:53:06,130
あぁ やっと言えた
Ah, I finally said it.

423
00:53:06,130 --> 00:53:22,080
これは絶対嘘じゃない 愛してる
This is definitely not a lie. I love you.

424
00:53:45,430 --> 00:53:57,330
ぱれぱれぱれ 輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を合図に
Parade, parade, parade, shining brightly, taking our calling voices as a signal,

425
00:53:59,430 --> 00:54:04,830
ぱれぱれぱれ 探しに行く スタートなんだってば
Parade, parade, parade, going out to search, this is just the start!

426
00:54:05,530 --> 00:54:10,630
ただとなりのだって まぶしすぎた名前
Just because the name right beside me was too dazzling,

427
00:54:10,630 --> 00:54:15,030
ただやさしすぎる思い出 もっと近づいて手を伸ばした
Just because of memories that were too kind, I got closer and reached out my hand.

428
00:54:22,630 --> 00:54:29,930
2つ目のいっぽは これだ! ジャケットも! わーい!
The second step is this! And the jacket too! Yay!

429
00:54:32,030 --> 00:54:36,630
ただひとりごとつづった ただ始まりたくて走った
Just whispering to myself alone, just running because I wanted it to begin,

430
00:54:41,630 --> 00:54:46,130
遠く暗がりにとまった それはまぶしすぎた名前
Stopping far away in the dark, that name was too dazzling.

431
00:54:46,930 --> 00:54:52,130
それはやさしすぎる思い出 もっと近づいて手を伸ばした
That memory was too kind, so I got closer and reached out my hand.

432
00:55:00,176 --> 00:55:06,928
想いが芽結び合った ほら今 マイストは僕らになった
Our feelings have blossomed and connected... Look, now our style belongs to all of us!

433
00:55:07,984 --> 00:55:16,024
パレパレパレ 輝くんだよ 悔しさも愛おしさも連れて おいでおいで
Parade, parade, parade, shining bright! Bring along your frustrations and your dearest affections, come on over!

434
00:55:17,744 --> 00:55:27,054
風 夢 跳ね 飛び立てるさ ささやかな祈り 光 終わりなき気配
Wind, dreams, leaps—we can take flight! A modest prayer, light, and an endless presence...

435
00:55:27,594 --> 00:55:30,494
君と見つけたこと
What I found together with you...

436
00:55:30,914 --> 00:55:40,544
腕を振れよ ここから これから アワフライ パレパワード
Swing your arms! From here, from now on, our bright parade!

437
00:55:49,294 --> 00:55:52,884
頼りない予感を
Unreliable premonitions...

438
00:55:53,124 --> 00:55:57,284
歌うのを 恥ずかしかなてないよ
I won't feel embarrassed about singing them!

439
00:55:57,964 --> 00:56:07,484
誰も解けない街並み いつか また会えるおまちない
In a cityscape no one can decipher, a charm so we can meet again someday...

440
00:56:08,664 --> 00:56:18,604
あの日 ゼロに始まったストーリー 数え切れないことの波 数えるような思い出じゃないさ
That story that started at zero on that day—it's not just memories to count like endless waves!

441
00:56:19,104 --> 00:56:23,844
ほら 今 僕らを一つとよう
Look, now let's become one!

442
00:56:24,364 --> 00:56:33,364
パレパレパレ 美しいんだよ 許し合える切なさ 夜は煌めく
Parade, parade, parade, it's so beautiful—the sorrow we can forgive in each other, as the night sparkles!

443
00:56:34,504 --> 00:56:42,264
雨 晴れ 晴れ まだ見ぬ空 不思議な導きと
Rain, clear skies—a still-unseen sky, with a mysterious guidance...

444
00:56:42,724 --> 00:56:46,164
君と歩くことさ
Walking with you...

445
00:56:46,424 --> 00:56:52,424
君と歩くことなんだ
Yes, walking together with you!

446
00:56:52,904 --> 00:57:04,384
高鳴る胸の奥に お帰りって叫ぶよ 当たり前じゃないから
Deep within my pounding chest, I'll shout "Welcome back!" because it's not something to take for granted.

447
00:57:06,364 --> 00:57:16,204
パレパレパレ 輝くんだよ 暗がりを満たすのは君だ 僕だ
Parade, parade, parade, shining bright! What fills the darkness is you... and me!

448
00:57:17,564 --> 00:57:25,644
パレパレパレ 輝くんだよ 悔しさも愛おしさも連れて おいでおいで
Parade, parade, parade, shining bright! Bring along your frustrations and your dearest affections, come on over!

449
00:57:27,224 --> 00:57:32,584
風 夢 跳ね 飛び立てるさ ささやかな祈り
Wind, dreams, leaps—we can take flight! A modest prayer...

450
00:57:32,984 --> 00:57:36,664
光 終わりなき気配
Light, an endless presence...

451
00:57:37,044 --> 00:57:42,544
君と飛び込んでゆく 素敵なスタートさ
Diving in together with you—what a wonderful start!

452
00:57:42,964 --> 00:57:51,444
ここから これから アワフライ パレパワード
From here, from now on, our bright parade!

453
00:57:51,664 --> 00:58:01,444
アワフライ パレパワード
Our bright parade!

454
00:58:10,588 --> 00:58:13,288
はい、というわけで！
Yes, and with that!

455
00:58:13,988 --> 00:58:17,388
「Our Bright Parade」をアイドル風でした！
We performed "Our Bright Parade" in an idol style!

456
00:58:17,788 --> 00:58:22,088
そしてじゃーん！お衣装二つ目ですね！
And ta-da! This is our second outfit!

457
00:58:22,488 --> 00:58:26,588
1つ目、2つ目ってきちゃったら…？
When we go from the first to the second...

458
00:58:26,888 --> 00:58:31,088
みんな見えてくれないよ！ジャケット可愛いよ！
Everyone check it out! The jacket is so cute!

459
00:58:31,588 --> 00:58:38,588
ちょっと同じ最初なんだけど、ジャケットがあるだけでさ、全然違うイメージになるよね！
It's the same base outfit, but just having the jacket changes the vibe completely, doesn't it?

460
00:58:38,888 --> 00:58:46,588
すごいさ、なんか、いっぱいの衣装を一気に貰った感じがして、ドキドキしちゃう！
It feels amazing, like getting so many outfits all at once, it makes my heart race!

461
00:58:47,088 --> 00:58:52,088
みんなこれもゲットしてね！
Everyone please get this too!

462
00:58:52,588 --> 00:58:55,588
はい、というわけで！
Yes, and with that!

463
00:58:56,088 --> 00:59:02,588
ここでみんな待ってたかな？グッズもあるよ！みんなも見せてこ、ポンっ！
Have you all been waiting for this? There's merchandise too! Let's show everyone, ta-da!

